# G-L3 on the 2 vCPU / 8 GiB VM (hlm-2604), R2 3535bcc9bf66 with the librarian LIVE (observer, gpt-6-luna), 2026-09-24
# From the Mac through Caddy (https://localhost:19443, CA-verified): warm-up 20 queries, quiet reference 60 queries (3 callers, no writes),
# then 3 query callers timed DURING 100 sequential acknowledged memory.write calls (~6 kB bodies; each enqueues a librarian_write job, priority 3).
